#: tips.cpp:3
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" align=\"center\">\n"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/32x32/apps/digikamimageplugins.png\">\n"
"</td>\n"
"<td>\n"
"Did you know that you can keep a zone clear of raindrops with the\n"
"'Select' tool? Selecting the area to avoid (for example a face) before\n"
"launching the 'RainDrops' filter will keep it free from rain drops.\n"
"</td>\n"
"</tr>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" align=\"center\">\n"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/32x32/apps/digikamimaxeplugins.png\">\n"
"</td>\n"
"<td>\n"
"Sabia que pode manter unha zona libre de pingas de chuvia coa ferramenta\n"
"de seleczón? Se escolle a área a evitar (por exemplo unha cara) antes de\n"
"lanzar o filtro «Pingas de Chuvia» manterá-a libre de pingas.\n"
"</td>\n"
"</tr>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:21
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" align=\"center\">\n"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/32x32/apps/digikamimageplugins.png\">\n"
"</td>\n"
"<td>\n"
"Did you know that you can simulate the graininess of black-and-white photos "
"with the 'FilmGrain' image editor plugin.\n"
"</td>\n"
"</tr>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" align=\"center\">\n"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/32x32/apps/dixikamimaxepluxins.png\">\n"
"</td>\n"
"<td>\n"
"Sabia que pode simular o grao das fotos antigas en branco e negro co plugin "
"de edizón de imaxe «Grao de Filme»?\n"
"</td>\n"
"</tr>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</p>\n"
